          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár Yesu niwa baraá Doó Mungú wa ti'imiiti, eeharusmoowós oo wák guna báy, «Intsaahhatusámo, tlaa/eeká', nee do'wí i ge/eéra, a gár waa/oo/amo.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu guri báy, «Adór do'wí úr kura tleéhh a ga/eéra? Ala tlaa/anoó gawaá kuqií meét i kaahh oo ta fee/iiká.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam qoomár Yesu iwa iwiít gawaá tloomár xaaikaari ta babay seituúni, iwa amór Doó Mungú i xumiisi, Petro nee Yakobo nee Yohane nee Andrea tawa kilooín, kuri yaahaás kuri báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Atén i ooang, kangwsíng i tleehharuuti a xaylá, nee layár ta ari a umós, qoomár kaangwí birna tseewúy?»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu iri dir'ínií axweés iwa kaahi, «Ti harmagahhe', hee munduwa al/aáy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk yaariír ni hardah oo ti umuueénár ateetiím, tawa kaahi, ‹Aníng a Kristo.› Nee inooín múk yaariír kuri al/aay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' kángw slaqwara bura axasé', nee tsimaahhír slaqwara, ma da'ayuutara', asma muruuwí niqo geerií hardah, ala alhhe'eesáydá' aa xayká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma xooro i slaqwarár eér amór xoororqá', nee waawuti'iima i slaqwarár eér amór waawuti'iimár hatlá'. Yaamaá yaariire kunseeli i ti'ít, slám giyeé ni tleér. Tí sleémeero an iimu/úngw slahh'amu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kuungá' ti harmagahhe' asma tundu huwahuuw baraá maraá kwasleema, nee baraá maraá saaliingo tundu muux. Kuungá' sleeme tundu huwahuuw dír geeraá ga/aawuuse, nee dír geeraá waawitá asma aníng, as iwa dir'ínií lamabu'uunda'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Ya/abtór hho' aqo kan geerií alki/iit baraá xoordu sleémeero dír alhhe'eesaydá' nira hardihiiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bar kuungá' tunda uhín, tunday huúw as tunduwa sakwasleemuuti, gár ta oa' ma geerií leelehhiitara', ala tidá' siiwadaádae tindi haniisi na ooaak. Asma heé axweés qoomaadae a kuungaeeká, a Qeeruú hhoohhoó' oo Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hhiya' hhiyaawós gu sakii/ kuwa gaasi, nee baabá na/aywós gu sakii/, na/ii nee xwaylitér'ín ti dakuusiyá' sleeme, xwaylité kay tsuu/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' tundu aahh nee muu sleémeero asma aníng. Ala heé aa qiitl ay alhhe'eesaay an kudá' ba/ám.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kudá' tlaákw oo Hhiturusmo bura aandé', aa sihhiít didaádá' iwa harinaká» (heé soomuús gídaabárós ngi tsaahhi), «qoomaadae múk yaamaá Yudeár i dirií' ta ta'aain gawaá tlom'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé gawaá do' miwa aweér as gár baraá do' ngiwa leehhi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee heé baraá qaymórií dirií' miwa kií/ iwa tlabaawós leehhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala /ameenár tsiihaawe nee ar na/aá ninakw gi koom qoomaadae, a tsaxwaaín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fiririimé' as kaangwí mindiwa qoomár tsaaqwárií ti'iít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma slahh'amuú deeloodá' ku úr adór taa baloó ariiká baraá yaamuwo iimír Mungú yaamu ngiwa tleéhh ay laarí, slám slahh'amuú adór kwí baloó ki/iiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Aako bar deeloorí gaa /aareesiiká geeraawo, heé geeraawo ba/ám i kaahh. Ala inós deeloodá' gana /aareés as mukdá' inós aa tsawaár.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Nee qoomaadae heeko burna báy, ‹Kristo areengw i diirí,› laqaá bira oó', ‹I amorqá',› ma ya/aamara'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma kristo lama nee aaruusér lamuusero ni ti'iitiyá'. Inooín layu nee muruú waa/oo/amooro ngu tleehhiyá' as múk yaariír kuwa al/ayi, bir ya/aán tam mukdá' Mungú aa tsawaár sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuungá' ti harmagahhe', asma án umuú gaaro ngaa kuungá' báw.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala deeloodaádae alaá slahh'amuuwo tsee/amá in giiw, nee slahhaangw i gwa/aatiiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsatse/uú gawaá doori i paahh, nee /uuruudá' doori gi koóm ku dingiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Garmoó Hee kuri ar i awdiit ar huunkáy, ar /uuruú úr nee xirif, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aluuwo malayke gari ya/aaw, badu tsiyahhaawo awa yaamu, iimír alhhe'eesaywí wa tleemu ay kuqá', as mukós kudá' aa tsawaár nguwa burumbut.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Slaqsoó /aantsí nu intsaahhatisi. Qoomár loo/orós bira páhh, ar /aben nay harmá/, a xuá' adór tluwaay nira nakaá/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam kuungá' sleeme muruuwí bura aandé' naxes naa iimu/ún, tsaahhaagáy adór Kristo nira tseewúy i dír afkú do'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Án a kah, muruuwí sleémeero i boo/ dír mukuú de'emaaká' ir kumiiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doori nee yaamu i waarahhiyá', ala axweesante'eé' i baloó waarahhká.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala kángw siiwadá' nee baalaarós heé gu xuú' i kaahh, tam malaykér gawaá doori, tam Garma, aqo har Baabá. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dalaaé' ti harmagahhe', asma siiwadá' a xua'aaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slaqsaywós a adór heé aa aa'aá kay, oo do'ós gwa dír lawaaleerós i geexay, nee umuúqo heewo gwa gadiyeérós i haniís. Heé afkú doó xuúm guri hara'ayín do' nguwa xun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gimsé', dalaaé', asma qoomár heé do' loó' ni hardihi a xua'aaká, tam tsiindo, tam amsi, tam ságw looaytleemu, tam matlaatle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laqaá munduwa baraá gu'uteérí hhaawiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee tí naa kuungá' báw tawa dala'a, an káh sleeme dír muu sleémeerowo.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
